                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a2382ce5-0c50-399a-9e47-c5194bb4d256",
                        "entry_id": "d227748b-eb36-3610-98f9-998a4cc1831e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Réémettre, sur le réseau Twitter, les messages que l'on a reçus."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "110bb446-71b9-482b-bfc9-d04e3da4c1d7",
                                "sense_id": "a2382ce5-0c50-399a-9e47-c5194bb4d256",
                                "text": "Sa chute finale serait ressentie avec émotion et respect. Toute la région, au delà du Montcuquois, retwitterait #hommage\nMais les vieilles enseignes doivent laisser la place aux vainqueurs de la guerre économique. Comme dans les cimetières les vieux morts doivent laisser la place aux jeunes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f670b7b1-984f-45f1-bb1e-a867fecc473b",
                                "sense_id": "a2382ce5-0c50-399a-9e47-c5194bb4d256",
                                "text": "Elle avait plusieurs fois entendu son ami dire son admiration pour César Diaz et sa Black Clowns Army, mais, il ne retwittait pas les messages liés au PIFR."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6acc03b-49ea-4f92-9f6c-6ca5a0d15041",
                                "sense_id": "a2382ce5-0c50-399a-9e47-c5194bb4d256",
                                "text": "Tout comme sur Facebook, Twitter vous permet de créer une communauté de fidèles et d'attirer les prospects, quand vos « followers » retwittent vos messages à leurs propres abonnés."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "666be083-79ef-49da-813e-f914dc9d59e2",
                                "sense_id": "a2382ce5-0c50-399a-9e47-c5194bb4d256",
                                "text": "Au-delà de 500 followers, vous pénétrez dans l'aristocratie du réseau et vos amis vous supplient de les «retwitter» (reposter leurs messages) afin de gagner en visibilité."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "36b6d887-c0a6-4a9a-9e9f-78d3f6cd6676",
                        "source_entry_id": "d227748b-eb36-3610-98f9-998a4cc1831e",
                        "source_sense_id": "a2382ce5-0c50-399a-9e47-c5194bb4d256",
                        "target_lang_word": "retweet",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "retweet",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82e5ad61-4c47-3420-8344-2d95e0199c25",
                                        "entry_id": "34db037e-da3a-31b9-ae4a-03b943a390e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To repost or forward another user's message on the microblogging social networking website Twitter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5741737b-2fd3-40f0-a906-28cec1b0ea48",
                                                "sense_id": "82e5ad61-4c47-3420-8344-2d95e0199c25",
                                                "text": "Because your messages will be relevant to them, they are much more likely to retweet your messages and recommend that other people follow you on Twitter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4317837a-d4e2-4ac1-bc37-7be86f66ac7c",
                                                "sense_id": "82e5ad61-4c47-3420-8344-2d95e0199c25",
                                                "text": "And the web—particularly social media—provides countless opportunities for intertextuality, chances to recontextualize, retweet, repost, riposte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a108f67-4814-4b41-851e-5eb93728430f",
                                                "sense_id": "82e5ad61-4c47-3420-8344-2d95e0199c25",
                                                "text": "On Friday, it urged followers: “Retweet if you believe that Trump & his cronies are lying to the public and treating us like we’re stupid. We won’t be fooled by their games.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "retweet",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fbbbedda-cf91-32dc-a5f7-9d88a9b150c6",
                                        "entry_id": "30aa889c-9909-37fd-8f6e-3b971a238a6a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A message reposted or forwarded in this way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73d76420-6b2c-46dc-8161-10a3aa9e0ad6",
                                                "sense_id": "fbbbedda-cf91-32dc-a5f7-9d88a9b150c6",
                                                "text": "You know it's an iPhone or iPad app, but those new to you, who came via a retweet or Twitter search, may not know which platform your app supports."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0293cddf-b314-4708-90a6-25977a7479a0",
                                                "sense_id": "fbbbedda-cf91-32dc-a5f7-9d88a9b150c6",
                                                "text": "According to Stewart's analysis, current case law makes it unlikely a retweeter would be held liable for a defamatory retweet […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9309a25-cc6d-4632-82a3-0db5182fbb55",
                                                "sense_id": "fbbbedda-cf91-32dc-a5f7-9d88a9b150c6",
                                                "text": "The sheer density of information and misinformation at the End, encapsulated in news articles and message-board theories and clickbait traps that had propagated hysterically through retweets and shares, had effectively rendered us more ignorant, more helpless, more innocent in our stupidity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "707ef163-7ac8-486d-9567-715a468f3215",
